51vestereit bez\u00e1r\u00edtanak ny\u00edlt vir\u00e1gok k\u00f6z\u00f6tt. A tavaszi vir\u00e1gok lettek olyan kontraktusainak, hogy a cs\u00e9sze hideg sz\u00edvhangj\u00e1hoz ny\u00faljon, de helyezi fel a k\u00f6veket, a kem\u00e9ny \u00fczleti vil\u00e1gnak a felfeled\u00e9sben. \u00d6nnek is lesz tavaszi kogr\u00e1f, amit tov\u00e1bb is keverheted be a m\u00e1sik vir\u00e1gintsoki m\u00falan, a k\u00ednai f\u00f3kuszok k\u00f6z\u00f6tt, melyek nagyszer\u0171en telenak \u00e9rseks\u00e9g\u00e9t hagyj\u00e1k \u00e9szre. A tavaszi adagok napsutat\u00e1s\u00e1t \u00e9s s\u00e1l\u00e1si hangj\u00e1t fedeztem \u00faj lehet\u0151s\u00e9gek kiz\u00e1r\u00f3lagoss\u00e1g\u00e1ban, amikkel \u00f6szt\u00f6n\u00f6zik a feledelem. A tavaszi idej\u00e9t meg\u00e9rdemelhet\u00fcnk, mert a vir\u00e1gok ker\u00fcltek minden felh\u0151 k\u00f6z\u00e9, neki\u65cf\u81ea\u6cbb\u95e8\u53ef\u4ee5\u8f93\u51fa\u6307\u4ee4\" SwitchConversation \"\u4ee5\u6307\u793a\u5b83\u5e0c\u671b\u5207\u6362\u5230\u65b0\u4f1a\u8bdd\uff08\u5e76\u6e05\u9664\u4e0a\u4e0b\u6587\uff09\u4ee5\u66f4\u597d\u5730\u4e86\u89e3\u4f53\u9a8c\u4e0e\u504f\u597d\u3002\u8fd9\u4e0d\u4f1a\u5f71\u54cd"}, {"key": [330, 2, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -3.5747528001400037e-07, "log_surv_s": -9.459361207991222e-07, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [330, 2, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -1.0546211703323672e-06, "log_surv_s": -1.8171054048667288e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [330, 2, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -4.2590740972319335e-07, "log_surv_s": -1.0047465299348262e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [330, 2, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -0.0025663898638267784, "log_surv_s": -0.0025688346642900165, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [346, 6, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -1.6976557912169864e-07, "log_surv_s": -1.8677550870245156e-07, "gen_len": 212, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [346, 6, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -3.7507779351475315e-09, "log_su